# CITATION.cff — métadonnées de citation (format Citation File Format v1.2)
# Étude : Laya Football Evaluation — https://github.com/steve-dev-55/laya-football-evaluation
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Si vous utilisez ce protocole, ce code ou ces résultats dans vos travaux,
  merci de citer cette étude.
title: >-
  Laya as a probabilistic decision engine for football: a preregistered,
  multi-instant, multi-agent evaluation protocol
abstract: >-
  Preregistered experimental protocol and reference implementation evaluating
  Laya, a typed AI decision engine, as a probabilistic forecaster of football
  match outcomes (1X2 result, score buckets, corners, yellow cards) across
  fixed and event-driven in-play snapshots, against reproducible statistical
  baselines, with point-in-time anti-leakage guarantees, stratified grouped
  bootstrap inference and Holm-Bonferroni correction.
